{"seq":25,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"7c2ae7f5-c0ac-4659-8585-61b4b733e597","runId":"run_1_1788376656964","result":"Done! I've created `/app/run.py` with the `run_tasks` function.\n\nHow it works:\n- **`asyncio.Semaphore`** limits how many tasks run concurrently by forcing each task to acquire/release the semaphore before/after execution\n- **`asyncio.gather()`** waits for all wrapped tasks to complete\n- **Cleanup on interrupt**: When you hit Ctrl+C, asyncio cancels pending tasks, but running tasks still execute their `finally` blocks and async context manager cleanup code (`__aexit__`)\n\nYou can use it like:\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom run import run_tasks\n\nasync def task1():\n    try:\n        # work\n    finally:\n        # cleanup always runs\n        pass\n\nawait run_tasks([task1, task2, task3], max_concurrent=5)\n```","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":11197,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7c2ae7f5-c0ac-4659-8585-61b4b733e597","total_cost_usd":0.0124172,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_read_input_tokens":26187,"output_tokens":1285,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":757},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1802},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":359,"cache_read_input_tokens":13498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":993,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":993,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1024,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001104,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":1285,"cacheReadInpu